<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Welcome to Freminatos</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f5f5f5;
        color: #333;
      }
      .email-wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .email-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d7377, #14a085);
        padding: 40px 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .email-header p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .email-body {
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #0d7377;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .email-body p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #555;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .highlight-box {
        background: #f0fafa;
        border-left: 4px solid #0d7377;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .highlight-box p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #0d7377;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #0d7377;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 8px 0;
      }
      .btn-secondary {
        display: inline-block;
        background: transparent;
        color: #0d7377 !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        border: 2px solid #0d7377;
        margin: 8px 0;
      }
      .btn-center {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      .divider {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      .programs {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .program-card {
        flex: 1;
        background: #f9f9f9;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 16px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .program-card .icon {
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .program-card p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #666;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .email-footer {
        background: #2d2d2d;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-footer p {
        color: #999;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .email-footer a {
        color: #0d7377;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .social-links {
        margin: 16px 0;
      }
      .social-links a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 0 6px;
        color: #bbb;
        font-size: 13px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='email-wrapper'>

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class='email-header'>
        <h1>🌿 Freminatos Charity</h1>
        <p>Restoring Lives. Rebuilding Hope.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div class='email-body'>
        <p class='greeting'>Welcome, {{firstName}}! 👋</p>

        <p>
          We are thrilled to have you join the Freminatos community. Your
          account has been successfully created and you are now part of a
          movement that is changing lives in Tigray, Ethiopia.
        </p>

        <div class='highlight-box'>
          <p>
            🎉 You joined as:
            <strong>{{role}}</strong><br />
            📧 Your email:
            <strong>{{email}}</strong>
          </p>
        </div>

        <p>
          To get the most out of your account, please verify your email address
          by clicking the button below:
        </p>

        <div class='btn-center'>
          <a href='{{verificationUrl}}' class='btn'>
            ✅ Verify My Email
          </a>
        </div>

        <p style='font-size: 13px; color: #999; text-align: center;'>
          This link expires in 24 hours. If you did not create this account, you
          can safely ignore this email.
        </p>

        <hr class='divider' />

        <p style='font-weight: 600; color: #333; margin-bottom: 16px;'>
          What you can do as a member:
        </p>

        <div style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>
          <p>💬
            <strong>Comment on news posts</strong>
            — Share your thoughts and engage with our community updates</p>
          <p>📋
            <strong>Apply for expert membership</strong>
            — Contribute your professional skills to support our programs</p>
          <p>📰
            <strong>Stay informed</strong>
            — Get the latest news about our children's care, elderly support,
            and recovery programs</p>
          <p>🏗️
            <strong>Support the new building</strong>
            — Follow our fundraising progress for the new Freminatos facility</p>
        </div>

        <hr class='divider' />

        <div class='btn-center'>
          <a href='{{appUrl}}' class='btn-secondary'>
            🌐 Visit Our Website
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out
          to us at
          <a
            href='mailto:info@freminatos.org'
            style='color: #0D7377;'
          >info@freminatos.org</a>
        </p>

        <p>
          With gratitude,<br />
          <strong>The Freminatos Team</strong>
          🌿
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class='email-footer'>
        <p>
          <strong style='color: #fff;'>Freminatos Charity Organization</strong>
        </p>
        <p>Mekelle, Tigray, Ethiopia</p>
        <div class='social-links'>
          <a href='#'>Facebook</a>
          ·
          <a href='#'>YouTube</a>
          ·
          <a href='#'>Telegram</a>
          ·
          <a href='#'>Instagram</a>
        </div>
        <p>
          You received this email because you registered on
          <a href='{{appUrl}}'>freminatos.org</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>